bmit by Monday/Tuesday 17/18 Nov. RCL: Loan agreement still not certified. Applicant to also submit most recent FS for Ability Holdings Ltd as the lending party, as well as a certified director's register of Ability Holdings Ltd Thank you for your consideration."},{"title":"Company Details","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-21","description":"The Company name and registered address are not displayed in the site footer, nor in the T&Cs. The company details must be visible in both the homepage footer and the T&Cs. Kindly amend.","notes":"11/04/2025: Applicant's reply: The applicant confirmed that this is duly noted. This will be completed and evidence will be provided. 11/04/2025: Please be reminded to upload the evidence as previously indicated. Kindly ensure submission on or before November 15, 2025. 17/11/2025 tests show domains are licensed in IOM. Check with local service provider if license is active and if so in which countries please. 11/15/2025: Applicant's reply: 13 Nov 2025 The operator provided snippet proof that the information is displayed in the footer. 2 proofs are submitted via the extra-documentation section Nov 14.25. Please advise. Thank you"},{"title":"Domain Ownership","tag":"Operations","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-12","description":"The site footer and T&Cs refer to an Isle of Man company, seemingly licensed by the GSC. Please clarify whether the applicant company will be operating the domain.","notes":"11/04/2025: Applicant's reply: The Operator informed that it is dual-licensed. Operator will provide its services to permitted jurisdictions to its respected Regulatory body."},{"title":"Terms and Conditions","tag":"Operations","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-12","description":"The T&Cs state that the document is governed by the laws of Isle of Man. The T&Cs must be governed by the laws of Curacao. Kindly amend.","notes":"11/04/2025: Applicant`s reply: The applicant comfirmed that it is duly noted. This will be noted in the T&C’s and evidence of the modifications will be provided. 11/04/2025: Evidence has been uploaded under the tab Extra Documentation."},{"title":"Prohibited Jurisdictions","tag":"Question","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-12","description":"The T&Cs do not provide a list of prohibited/restricted territories. Players residing in Curacao, the Netherlands, US and sanctioned/blacklisted countries should not be allowed to register.","notes":"11/04/2025: Applicant's reply: The applicant confirmed that this is duly noted,. This will be completed and evidence will be provided. 11/04/2025: Evidence uploaded under the tab Extra Documentation for review. 3/12 RCL approved"},{"title":"Detailed 3-year Financial Forecast","tag":"Financial Audit","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-28","description":"Please submit a detailed 3-year Financial Forecast.","notes":null}]}]}]}